1
00:00:00,606 --> 00:00:01,646
(Howard:)Professor Rothman.

2
00:00:01,857 --> 00:00:04,857
This isn't your office anymore.
You're retired.

3
00:00:05,777 --> 00:00:10,077
l think the word you're looking for
is "invisible."

4
00:00:15,329 --> 00:00:16,659
l came to say I'm sorry.

5
00:00:16,872 --> 00:00:19,002
- Don't bother.
- Oh, Amy, please.

6
00:00:19,207 --> 00:00:22,627
(Amy:)I'm so humiliated. I sat there the whole
time we were watching Grease...

7
00:00:22,836 --> 00:00:25,176
(Amy:)- ...thinking you liked the painting.
- l know.

8
00:00:25,380 --> 00:00:27,090
l was a fool from "summer loving"...

9
00:00:27,299 --> 00:00:30,089
...to the last "rama lama lama
ke ding a de dinga a dong."

10
00:00:31,261 --> 00:00:32,591
(Penny:)You're absolutely right.

11
00:00:32,804 --> 00:00:35,974
l should have been honest
and told you the gift was too much.

12
00:00:36,433 --> 00:00:40,103
(Amy:)Yes, too much. Because our friendship
is fundamentally asymmetrical.

13
00:00:40,312 --> 00:00:43,232
l clearly like you
more than you like me.

14
00:00:43,440 --> 00:00:46,570
l don't think you put a number
on how much one person likes another.

15
00:00:46,777 --> 00:00:49,317
l bought you a painting
that's 12 square feet in area.

16
00:00:49,529 --> 00:00:50,609
(Amy:)There's a number.

17
00:00:51,573 --> 00:00:52,653
(Penny:)Amy, come...

18
00:00:52,866 --> 00:00:56,826
(Amy:)If you don't like feet, you can try dollars.
The painting set me back 3 grand.

19
00:00:57,120 --> 00:01:00,020
Three gr?... Oh, my God.

